This package depends on, or takes patterns from, the following works.
No source was copied from copyleft (GPL/AGPL) projects.

Dependencies
- bitECS 0.4.0 (https://github.com/NateTheGreatt/bitECS), MPL-2.0.
  Used unmodified as an npm dependency; no bitECS source is vendored here.
- Rapier, @dimforge/rapier3d-deterministic-compat 0.21.0
  (https://github.com/dimforge/rapier), Apache-2.0. Used unmodified.

Code and patterns
- mulberry32 PRNG (src/rng.ts), by Tommy Ettinger, public domain.
- Fixed-timestep accumulator (src/stepper.ts) after Glenn Fiedler,
  "Fix Your Timestep!" (gafferongames.com); idea only.
- Snapshot delta compression against an acknowledged baseline
  (src/snapshot.ts) after Glenn Fiedler's "Snapshot Compression" and the
  Quake 3 network model; ideas only, no code.
- Zigzag varints after Protocol Buffers' encoding (BSD-3-Clause); idea only.
